 supervised by the Bahrawi Governorate, and when he seeks to reveal what he knew, the project beneficiaries fabricate the charge of embezzlement of Abd al-Baqi, and he enters prison From here, his daughter Widad (Firdous Abdel Hamid) cooperates with Bashir Abu Al-Saad (Mahmoud Al-Jundi) to prove her father's innocence, but they discover that the game is bigger than they imagined.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWEELJGT5FHNtY3JS23uEVv2jvL.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nWJM3zXmCV5n7VnykI5t8X0NcDW.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1989","release_date":"1989-04-06","runtime_minutes":46,"status":"Ended","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["كوميديا","دراما"],"genre_keys":["comedy","drama"],"similar":["tv80411","tv284744","tv208569","tv296140","tv102376","tv84334","tv52645","tv287344"],"director":"أسامة أنور عكاشة","cast":[{"name":"حسن عابدين","character":"عبدالباقي الجوهري","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tFxfjJfJdKfe9BwqXRJvT5rqSYY.jpg"},{"name":"محمود الجندي","character":"بشير أبو السعد","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8MejawbHRmanTm06Ww4fA9qjtCh.jpg"},{"name":"فردوس عبدالحميد","character":"وداد عبدالباقي الجوهري","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2oqC1EAwpoqUAxqsGVvcSDImq6N.jpg"},{"name":"المنتصر بالله","character":"حلاوة","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4AMmeiKoBaLlt4cdl8BoamyoBGF.jpg"},{"name":"حسن مصطفى","character":"أبو صالح العشري","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AwjOe9xr4saKbCxAvFFoZggyUCS.jpg"},{"name":"عبدالله فرغلي","character":"السمري بيه","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gM8eNT5xncTTOk6lN8I86Hh4nOJ.jpg"},{"name":"نور الدمرداش","character":"صديق عشم الخير","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7hnD5SodOYKPnHhaz7jdNanfpgX.jpg"},{"name":"حسن كامي","character":"السفير نجاتي سيف الدين","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7a80pOzNYVu3mD